      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedule(s)</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
